<center>
<TABLE WIDTH="600" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0">
<tr><td>
<h3>ORNL Universal Genome Analysis Pipeline</h3>
<p>
The pipeline can be used to analyze sequences from
several different Eukaryotic and Prokaryotic genomes. The user can select
from a list of supported analysis services for the selected organism type.
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td>
<br>
<h3><bold>Select Organism Type</bold></h3>

<A HREF="euk.html"><h4>Eukaryotic (Human and Mouse)</h4></A>
<A HREF="yeast.html"><h4>Eukaryotic (Yeast)</h4></A>
<A HREF="pro.html"><h4>Prokaryotic</h4></A>
</td></tr>

<tr><td>
